# Vercel only ever builds apps/web from this monorepo. Everything listed here is either
# regenerated during that build, deployed somewhere else (Railway runs the API and the judge
# worker), or dev-only tooling that the build graph never touches.
#
# NOTE: once this file exists Vercel consults it INSTEAD of .gitignore when deciding what to
# upload, so the ordinary ignores have to be repeated here rather than only the additions.

node_modules
dist
.next
.turbo
*.log
.env
.env.local
.DS_Store
coverage
.pnpm-store
apps/judge/boxes
packages/db/prisma/dev.db
generated
.claude/

# ~115MB of the repo's ~120MB: one-off data-seeding scripts, run by hand with tsx against a
# database. Nothing imports them (apps/web depends on @oj/shared alone), so they were being
# uploaded on every single deploy for no reason — and a source upload that large is what kept
# collapsing Vercel's /v2/files endpoint mid-transfer.
packages/db/scripts
